  "limitations": [
    "The review did not provide a detailed analysis of different cognitive abilities as outcomes in some areas.",
    "Existing reviews often focus on a single topic, lacking comprehensive summaries.",
    "Studies on mathematics in traffic noise are weak.",
    "Studies on reverberation time often overlook background sound limitations and placement.",
    "Current research on music's effect on learning efficiency is not completely certain.",
    "The regularity of interaction among age, task difficulty, and sound pressure level still needs in-depth study.",
    "Current studies on reverberation time primarily focus on RT, with very few studies on Speech Transmission Index (STI)."
  ],
